        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third‑person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush—just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br> 🌳 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> — Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> 🧭 <strong>Story without words</strong> — Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text — only emotion and full immersion.<br> 🐼 <strong>Panda abilities</strong> — Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> 🧩 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> — Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> 🗺️ <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> — No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> 🎮 <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> — A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/e2be03acce47e8b07c9d89e5d937f631.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red Panda: The Quiet Path</strong> is a charming, atmospheric third‑person adventure where you play as a red panda exploring a scenic, tranquil forest.<br>No words, no combat, no rush—just nature, silence, and a path that unfolds step by step. Immerse yourself in a meditative journey where the experience matters more than the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong><br> 🌳 <strong>Atmospheric world</strong> — Explore a bright and cozy forest filled with natural sounds, soft colors, hidden trails, and unexpected discoveries.<br> 🧭 <strong>Story without words</strong> — Everything is conveyed through the environment, visual storytelling, and sound. No text — only emotion and full immersion.<br> 🐼 <strong>Panda abilities</strong> — Climb trees, roll, swim across rivers, knock down objects, and even fly with a balloon.<br> 🧩 <strong>Gentle quests</strong> — Small, optional tasks gently guide your exploration and unveil new corners of the world.<br> 🗺️ <strong>Relaxed pacing</strong> — No pressure, no urgency. Go at your rhythm.<br> 🎮 <strong>Perfect for short sessions</strong> — A great way to relax and escape into a cozy forest world for a while.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.poster.avif?t=1761662280\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.webm?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771270/extras/200ac1672ad6f68cad9f73af4bbfa27c.mp4?t=1761662280\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
